# Sources, exposure and coverage

SOURCE_MANIFEST.json records exact paths, bytes, hashes and recoverable copies. All identities inherited from the bus manifest were reverified before reuse; the final freeze rechecks them again. No Git command was run, so supplied repository commit identities remain supplied provenance rather than independently queried Git state.

