During this task the root sent a scope correction: arbitrary exact computable logarithm entries cannot be tested for zero, and its pending checker was considering rational Hermitian approximation with decidable support and a paid error. That message was received before this freeze and is explicitly credited as exposure. The present bounded-unitary-log search, uniform time-first construction and attenuated-bias polynomial argument are author derivations, not an independent check of the root/checker work. No further worker science or unrelated candidate was inspected.

DERIVATION.md was cold-read completely in three bounded ranges without truncation. Its final explicit constant/dummy-weight corrections were reread. The entire actual check stdout/stderr was read. Source copies and hashes do not substitute for mathematical coverage or prove the new claims. No external research source was used.
